# Build output. Disposable, like __pycache__/ and .mypy_cache/ elsewhere in
# this repo. Generated *code* is the exception and IS committed -- see the Code
# Generation section of CLAUDE.md -- so crates/nmos-types/src/generated/ and
# crates/nmos-etcd/src/generated/ are deliberately not listed here.
/target

# The proto emitter is its own cargo workspace, excluded from the one above so
# that `prost-build`'s dependencies are not compiled by every ordinary build.
# Its own build output is disposable on the same terms; its Cargo.lock is
# committed, because a tool that emits committed code should emit the same
# thing next year as it does today.
/crates/nmos-etcd-codegen/target
